  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners Innovation Fund: C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Orange Corners Innovation Fund (OCIF) provides young entrepreneurs in the Orange Corners programme with access to funding of up to &#x20ac;50,000. This allows the entrepreneurs to develop their idea in a product/proposition that can enter the market.As OCIF aims to stimulate innovation, the innovative-aspect of the business will be an important criteria for the selection of participants in the programme. It will be a condition that each business idea will have positive social- or ecological impact and addresses at least one SDG.Furthermore, each entrepreneur will have to commit him/herself fully for the period of the incubation programme. If a business idea fits within the circular economy this will be a big plus.</narrative>
  </description>
